            "review_title": "Review at VIGOR - Dining Club Saigon",
            "review_text": "Emily Levert\nThe Hague, The Netherlands3249 contributions\n0\nIts always good to be here\nMay 2021\nIts always good to be here, special for sunset time for happy hours drinks then stay in the fine dining resto when the city lights all turn on, superb romantic for the couple. \n\nSpecially, amazing hospitality from Mr. Emilio - GM there, as always he never disappointed me and my gang.\nRead more\nWritten May 3, 2021",
